By the time you get into Gehommen you shouldn't have a single
piece of armour that isn't immune to fire, rust and so on.
Some items start out immune in the first place - Dragon scales,
silver shields and so on.  All other items need to be treated
before getting that deep.  Do you want to be spoiled on how?
If you don't want to be spoiled there is an Oracle message
that tells you how for the usual price (1000 zorkmids IIRC).

Also you yourself should be immune to fire by eating corpses
that give that immunity.  There are an assortment of immunities
possible from eating corpses and you should have all or most
of them before going below the Castle.

